-- s 18(3F): commencement 1 Dec 2027, on or after 1 Oct 2027: $10,000.
#ASSERT (`How much is my first home owner grant` `a comprehensive home building contract` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2027) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2027) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 410000 TRUE) EQUALS (`the grant amount is` 10000)
-- Completed 15 Nov 2028 (ready for occupation), asked 1 Dec 2028.
