-- s 12(2)(b)(ii): commencement on or after 1 Oct 2027: 6 months.
#ASSERT (`For how many months must I live in the home` `a comprehensive home building contract` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2027) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2027) FALSE 0) EQUALS 6
-- s 12(2)(a): 12 months after 15 Nov 2028.
#ASSERT (`By what date must I move into the home` `a comprehensive home building contract` (DATE_FROM_DMY 20 5 2026) TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 20 5 2026) (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 11 2028) FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2030)) EQUALS (DATE_FROM_DMY 15 11 2029)
-- Same couple, contract 1 Dec 2014: before 28 Apr 2015, s 12(4) does not apply and Ana has no s 12(3)(b) exemption.
#ASSERT (`Am I eligible for the first home owner grant` `a comprehensive home building contract` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2014) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2014) 24 FALSE `an Australian citizen` `no grant was paid on an earlier application` FALSE FALSE `never held a relevant interest in residential property in Australia` TRUE FALSE `a de facto partner` FALSE TRUE 17 FALSE `a New Zealand citizen who holds a special category visa` `no grant was paid on an earlier application` FALSE FALSE `never held a relevant interest in residential property in Australia` FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS (`not eligible` `s 12: an applicant will not meet the residence requirements and is not exempt`)
-- With the Commissioner's exemption for Ana (s 12(3)(b)), the 2014 application meets the criterion.
#ASSERT (`Am I eligible for the first home owner grant` `a comprehensive home building contract` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2014) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2014) 24 FALSE `an Australian citizen` `no grant was paid on an earlier application` FALSE FALSE `never held a relevant interest in residential property in Australia` TRUE FALSE `a de facto partner` FALSE TRUE 17 FALSE `a New Zealand citizen who holds a special category visa` `no grant was paid on an earlier application` FALSE FALSE `never held a relevant interest in residential property in Australia` FALSE TRUE FALSE) EQUALS `eligible: every applicant meets the eligibility criteria (ss 7(1)(a), 8-12A)`
-- Ana applying alone at 17, no exemption: s 8(1)(b).
#ASSERT (`Am I eligible for the first home owner grant` `a comprehensive home building contract` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2027) (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 12 2027) 17 FALSE `a New Zealand citizen who holds a special category visa` `no grant was paid on an earlier application` FALSE FALSE `never held a relevant interest in residential property in Australia` TRUE FALSE `a de facto partner` FALSE FALSE 0 FALSE `none of these` `no grant was paid on an earlier application` FALSE FALSE `never held a relevant interest in residential property in Australia` FALSE FALSE FALSE) EQUALS (`not eligible` `s 8(1)(b), (3): no applicant was 18 or over at the commencement date, and not every applicant has the Commissioner's exemption`)
