-- CASE 4. Sam builds a small home himself. HYPOTHETICAL: 40, citizen, single, owns the block. Signed a kit supply
-- contract 10 Jan 2026; laying the foundations began 1 Jul 2026; the work cost $45,000 (not counting his labour).
